    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1170030/extras/4431816f18b4c5e6a48a6387cd05449f.avif?t=1666985434\" /></div><br>The legend of the of Fortuna Land  says:<br>&quot;When a person is very greedy, he needs to be careful about the<br>Purple Plunder, he can carry all his treasures&quot;.<br>You control a creature called Purple Plunder,<br>you have the power of teleportation and need<br>teach that money is not everything to the most greedy creatures<br>and get all the gold you can get.<br>The Purple Plunder race: One-eyed creatures that look like starfish or spiders ,<br>can teleport and love to pick up gold from the greedy.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1170030/extras/d3dbb7699329c21b053ecbc55ed9b638.avif?t=1666985434\" /></div><br>Eye Of Plunder is an arcade labyrinth style game where you can <br>teleport to escape from enemies. <br>Each level you complete the game becomes harder and more enemies appear. <br>The levels are created randomly to make the adventure more fun.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Levels with Procedural generation.<br></li><li> Levels increased with progress.<br></li><li> Enemies have artificial intelligence.<br></li><li> You can teleport your character.<br></li><li> Retro Arcade Style.<br></li><li> Take the gold of the greedy enemies.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1170030/extras/4431816f18b4c5e6a48a6387cd05449f.avif?t=1666985434\" /></div><br>The legend of the of Fortuna Land  says:<br>&quot;When a person is very greedy, he needs to be careful about the<br>Purple Plunder, he can carry all his treasures&quot;.<br>You control a creature called Purple Plunder,<br>you have the power of teleportation and need<br>teach that money is not everything to the most greedy creatures<br>and get all the gold you can get.<br>The Purple Plunder race: One-eyed creatures that look like starfish or spiders ,<br>can teleport and love to pick up gold from the greedy.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1170030/extras/d3dbb7699329c21b053ecbc55ed9b638.avif?t=1666985434\" /></div><br>Eye Of Plunder is an arcade labyrinth style game where you can <br>teleport to escape from enemies. <br>Each level you complete the game becomes harder and more enemies appear. <br>The levels are created randomly to make the adventure more fun.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Levels with Procedural generation.<br></li><li> Levels increased with progress.<br></li><li> Enemies have artificial intelligence.<br></li><li> You can teleport your character.<br></li><li> Retro Arcade Style.<br></li><li> Take the gold of the greedy enemies.</li></ul>",
